G8623.definition:
1.  alternation, alternating motion  , τῶν σκελῶν (Plutarch) 
2.  a change for the worse, alteration  , (Plato Philosophus) 
from παραλλάσσω (ML)

G8640.definition:
1.  a placing in line of battle  , ἐκ παρατάξεως  in regular battle  , (Thucydides), etc. 
2. of  marshalling   a political party,  arrangement  , (Aeschines Orator) 
from παρατάσσω (ML)

G8679.definition:
1. φόνια πειρατήρια the murderous  ordeal  , (Euripides) 
2.  a pirate's nest  , (Strabo Geographus) 
from πειρα_τής (ML)
